    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553710/extras/3f2299e6602b457f7b68467d2af224f6.avif?t=1747058458\" width=800 height=374 /></span><br>Ponkots is a casual coop 2D game currently in development for 3 to 8 players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players control the small toys and avoid the &quot;Houdan&quot; and escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Escape from the Evil Tin Kings</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Bad toy Kings are trying to capture the small toys. The interference attacks from them are really troublesome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And the small toys sometimes become Ponkots (unresponsive). When that happens, everyone need help each oher to save Ponkots small toys don't get hit by the &quot;Houdan&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to escape together!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553710/extras/3f2299e6602b457f7b68467d2af224f6.avif?t=1747058458\" width=800 height=374 /></span><br>Ponkots is a casual coop 2D game currently in development for 3 to 8 players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players control the small toys and avoid the &quot;Houdan&quot; and escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Escape from the Evil Tin Kings</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Bad toy Kings are trying to capture the small toys. The interference attacks from them are really troublesome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And the small toys sometimes become Ponkots (unresponsive). When that happens, everyone need help each oher to save Ponkots small toys don't get hit by the &quot;Houdan&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to escape together!</p>",
    "short_description": "PONKOTS is a casual coop game currently in development for 3 to 8 players. Control small toys to escape from the bad, toy kings.",
